or PLC in Otsego County","/arc-plc/new-york/otsego-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025 the middle ran 77% of normal for July to August and 161% for May to June. Grid 27222 had its driest year in 1964 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
